{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちはー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/11/5624514/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"............本当にすいません<(_ _*)>\n桜井はそろそろ花粉の攻撃を受け始めていますが、元気にやっております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/11/5624514/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木どこ?はバレンタインデー企画でしたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/11/5624514/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も久しぶりにリアルタイムで見ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/11/5624514/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、あれは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥ずかしいものの何ものでもない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんな告白出来るかよーーん!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それ以前に桜井は、自分から告白は出来ないタイプなんじゃないかなぁー?とやってみて思いました。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってます、\n皆さんからの『告白』を......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁー今度の握手会が楽しみだなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生初のモテ期が到来してしまうのだろうなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん告白してくれる人がいるんだろうなーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしてるよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/11/5624514/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何だろ、今急に甘いモノが欲しくなってきた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、いいこと思いついたよ!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんの忘れられない甘ーい思い出とか教えて欲しいな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何でもいい!!\nもちろん恋愛の事でもいいし、\n握手会での出来事でもいいし、\n夢で見た内容でもいいし........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か甘ーいエピソード教えてください♪♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして皆様にご報告。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月から大学生になります!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会などで心配して下さっていた方々がいらっしゃったので、乃木ファンの皆様にはご報告します"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/11/5624514/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この事はまた改めて、Blogで書きます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/11/5624514/0005.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}